This file covers third-party code and palette data included in tinyedit:

- linenoise.c / linenoise.h -- vendored in full for historical reference
  (see README.md's "Struttura del codice" section: not compiled into the
  current binary, kept from the project's original line-editor prototype).
- utf8.c / utf8.h -- UTF-8 decoding, grapheme-cluster boundary detection,
  and terminal display-width calculation, ported from linenoise.c.

